  "engine": "8RESV(L): Kohler SV620 single-cylinder, 597 cc, 8.5:1. 10/12RESV(L): Kohler KT725 twin-cylinder, 725 cc, 9.0:1 (SiteTech engine model KT-725-2 on 10RESV, KT-725 on 12RESV). Air-cooled, 3600 rpm, CD ignition, stepper-motor governor.",
  "fuel": "Natural gas or LPG vapor, field-convertible. Original fuel system uses a fuel selector valve; a revised system (Feb 2021) uses NG/LPG fuel jet fittings in a regulator with an integral solenoid valve. Supply pressure NG 3.5-11 in. WC (0.87-2.7 kPa), LPG 7-11 in. WC (1.7-2.7 kPa). 1/2 in. NPT inlet.",
  "years": "c. 2014-present (SB-744 11/14, TP-6879 3/15; current TP-6880/6881/6984 rev 4/26). 8RESV(L) now listed as no longer available. DC2 controller discontinued; units built in 2019 and later have RDC2.",
