     "If the switch fails, put a gauge in the switch port. Oil pressure should be 172-241 kPa per TP-6881 p.11 (the psi figure is misprinted as '25--5'; 172-241 kPa is about 25-35 psi). Check pressure before you replace the switch.",
     "Bench test (engine manuals): the switch is closed at 0 psi, opens as pressure rises through 2-5 psi, and stays open up to 90 psi.",
