  "engine": "14 kW: Kohler CH740 Command PRO, 725 cc (44 cu in) V-twin, air-cooled, hydraulic lifters. 20 kW: Kohler CH1000, 999 cc (61 cu in) V-twin, air-cooled, hydraulic lifters. 3600 rpm (60 Hz) / 3000 rpm (50 Hz).",
  "fuel": "Natural gas or LPG vapor, field convertible. 14 kW built before 6/26/2014: fuel block (move hose fitting/plug between NG and LP ports). 14 kW after that: NG (silver) or LPG (gold) orifice fitting in the hose barb. 20 kW: loose LPG orifice in the hose fitting (none for NG). Revised fuel system (Feb 2021): selector knob on the regulator, NG = full clockwise, LP = full counterclockwise. 14 kW only: ignition timing leads 65 and N3 joined for NG, apart for LP. Change Fuel Type in the controller after conversion and order a new nameplate (rating changes).",
  "years": "c.2013-present (SB-722 dated 1/2013 covers 14/20RESA/L; revised controllers 2014; DC2 dropped 2019; revised fuel system 2/2021; TP-6803/6804/6805 current revision 4/26)",
