     "Speed gain default 50: if not 50 reset it; if 50 try steps of 5 down, then up.",
     "NG: no orifice, timing leads connected. LP: orifice in, leads disconnected.",
     "Re-seat carburetor, Loctite bolts.",
     "Trim carburetor gasket 0.75 mm (0.03 in.) at each opening if it touches the throttle plate (engines SN 4223605221 and up have a gasket that needs no trimming).",
     "Unplug the stepper harness at no load: if hunting continues it is not the controller - check regulator, fuel solenoid, plugs, leak-down test. If it stops, update RDC2 firmware to 4.09 or higher.",
