  "fuel": "Natural gas or LPG vapor, field convertible. Factory set for NG. Fuel supply pressure 1.2-2.7 kPa (5-11 in. WC) for both fuels. 1 in. NPT fuel inlet. Conversion = regulator adjusting cap + jumper wire N20 to wire 45 (plus fuel-valve lead changes on 24 kW built after Oct 2021), then set Fuel Type on the RDC2 and order a new nameplate.",
