    "Press Select to open the menus; you start in the Overview menu.",
    "Press the down arrow to the Next Maintenance screen.",
    "Press Select.",
    "Press the up arrow until 'Reset Maint Timer? Yes' shows.",
    "Press Select. The next maintenance hours and date are shown.",
    "Press AUTO."
