     "CKP: 5.0 V at pin 1 with key on; pins 2/3 to ECM 2/1 (4.3/5.0/5.7 chart) (TP-6724 p.104-105)",
     "CMP: 5.0 V at pin C; pin A to ECM 3, pin B to ECM 33 (TP-6724 p.171)",
