  "fuel": "Natural gas or LP vapor, factory set for NG. 48RCLB/60RCLA: LP = connect lead 49 to N17 and set Fuel Type LPG on the RDC2 (TP-7101 p.33; TP-7103 p.95). 48RCLC/60RCLB: also swap fuel-valve leads (see installNotes) (TP-7203 p.40). Optional automatic NG-to-LP dual fuel changeover kit with reset box (TP-7102 p.64; TP-7203 p.38-39).",
