  "engine": "12 kW: Kohler CH740, 725 cc (44 cu. in.) twin, 3600 rpm, hydraulic lifters, mechanical governor on 12RESL/12RESM1 (TP-6196 p.17-18, p.111). 17/18 kW: Kohler CH980, 999 cc (61 cu. in.) twin, electronic governor (stepper motor + magnetic pickup) (TP-6519 p.13, p.61). TP-6517 p.9: CH740 on 12RESL/12RESM1, CH980 on 18RESL; 18RESL engine certified for emergency standby use only.",
  "fuel": "Natural gas or LP vapor, field-convertible, shipped set up for natural gas. DC 2200 units: LP fuel jet 24 337 35 into the elbow fitting + disconnect DSAM leads (TP-6397 p.19). DC-RET units: LP orifice into the hose fitting + disconnect DSAI leads 65 and N5 (TP-6793 p.16-17, TP-6516 p.20-21). Connect the leads again for natural gas.",
  "years": "DC 2200: 2007 (TP-6397/TP-6398 dated 4/07). DC-RET: about 2009-2011+ (TP-6516 4/09, TP-6517 1/11, TP-6793 10/11).",
