     "Check stepper motor harness for loose/bad leads.",
     "Measure stepper coil resistance across pins 2-3 and pins 1-4 (BLK-YEL and RED-WHT groups): 38.5 ohm per half coil; replace if much higher or shorted.",
     "Stepper test: disconnect mag pickup, open breaker, close throttle by hand, start - stepper should drive to wide open and stay there."
