     "Check Uu setting and AC voltage; adjust 1P if needed. Check calibration (SiteTech, firmware 2.04+).",
     "Separately excite: 12 V battery + 10 A fuse + ammeter to FP/FN; current should be about battery volts / rotor ohms (rotor 5.2 ohm 14 kW, 5.6 ohm 20 kW). Rising current = shorted rotor; falling/unstable = running open.",
     "Check stator continuity and resistance (see alternator specs); megger 500 VDC, good is about 500 kohm or higher."
