     "Check fuel pressure at the secondary regulator inlet: 7-11 in. WC at rated load; check pipe size for the set plus all gas appliances (TP-6198 p.60).",
     "Check fuel select leads 65 and 70A: connected for NG, disconnected for LP (TP-6198 p.26; TP-6341 p.22).",
     "Check spark plugs (gap 0.8-0.9 mm / 0.031-0.035 in.), plug wires and connections; check battery and charger; check air cleaner.",
     "Check controller config: Uc01 and Ec03 (15 kW) or Ec06 (30 kW) (TP-6198 p.26, p.44).",
