     "Controller check: disconnect the starter motor lead at the solenoid, move switch to RUN - it should simulate cranking 15 s on / 15 s off and shut down after the third cycle (TP-6198 p.57).",
     "If OC comes on after only the FIRST crank cycle on a 15/30RES or 15/30RYG built before serial 2053692 with ADC program 1.18 or later: cut out a 1-inch section of the gray/orange lead at ECM connector pin 9 so the ADC (not the ECM) controls starting (SB-652)."
