  "specs": {
   "oil": "API Starburst oil FOR GASOLINE ENGINES; no diesel-formulated oils; CC or CD oils not acceptable even if labeled heavy duty or for natural gas engines. Multi-viscosity: SAE 10W-30 at -18°C (0°F) and above, 5W-30 below (TP-6726 p.21; TP-6728 p.23).",
   "oilCapacity": "3.5 L (3.7 qt.) with filter; 30 kW with oil makeup kit 5.4 L (5.7 qt.) (TP-6726 p.22; TP-6728 p.23; TP-6198 p.13). Makeup kit adds 2 qt with a glass sight gauge (TP-6725 p.26).",
   "sparkPlug": "Kohler P/N GM35826 (TP-6198 p.11 - listed for RES/RESA/REYG/RYG). 5/8 in. plug socket with rubber insert.",
   "plugGap": "0.9 mm (0.035 in.) per TP-6726 p.26 and TP-6728 gap table; TP-6728 gap figure and TP-6198 p.13 print 0.8-0.9 mm (0.031-0.035 in.).",
   "valveClearance": "No adjustment - hydraulic valve lifters (GM 1.6L engine manual TP-6362 p.252). Generator manuals give no lash value.",
   "compression": "No absolute value published. Engine warm (oil 80°C), plugs out, throttle wide open, crank ~4 s at min. 300 rpm: cylinders within 100 kPa (14.5 psi) of each other. Leakdown max 25% per cylinder, 10% max difference. Firing order 1-3-4-2 (TP-6362 p.222-224).",
   "torque": "Spark plug 25 Nm (18 ft-lb), or hand-tight then 1/4 turn (TP-6726 p.26; TP-6198 p.14). Alternator overbolts 34 Nm (25 ft-lb); drive disk to flywheel 16.5 Nm (12 ft-lb); cylinder head nuts 25 Nm (18 ft-lb); drive disk to rotor 38 Nm (28 ft-lb); muffler flange bolts 50 Nm (35 ft-lb); radiator fan fasteners 22.5 Nm (17 ft-lb) (TP-6198 p.14). Engine manual: head bolts (new) 25 Nm + 60° + 60° + 60° (TP-6362 p.253).",
   "battery": "12 V negative ground, minimum 525 CCA at 0°F (TP-6725 p.17, p.20; TP-6727 p.26). Charger: automatic float/equalize, 3 A or more (TP-6725 p.14).",
   "airFilter": "Dry-type element GM16944 (TP-6198 p.11). Tap clean; no liquid or compressed air; replace if damaged (TP-6726 p.22). 30RESA/30REYG LP units: see SB-703 resonator kit; replacement air cleaner assembly GM36199 if the cleaner was modified.",
   "fuelPressure": "7-11 in. WC (4-6 oz/in2) supply, NG and LP (TP-6727 p.30; TP-6724 fuel system section says the system runs 7 to 11 in. WC for NG and LP vapor). TP-6725 refers to the spec sheet for pressure. Service manual check point: secondary regulator inlet at rated load 178-280 mm (7-11 in.) WC (TP-6198 p.60). Leak-test at 10-14 in. WC with soap solution.",
   "exercise": "Run under load once a week for 20 minutes (TP-6726 p.14; TP-6728 p.15). Set the exerciser on the transfer switch (TP-6725 p.24; TP-6727 p.34).",
   "coolant": "50/50 ethylene glycol and softened water; 11.5 L (3.0 gal.) both sizes; pressure cap 97 kPa (14 psi); thermostat 91°C (195°F) (TP-6726 p.24; TP-6728 p.26; TP-6725 p.23).",
   "belt": "Alternator/fan belt deflection about 7-10 mm (0.3-0.4 in.) with finger pressure (TP-6726 p.27; TP-6728 p.29). Belt P/N 15 kW GM28353, 30 kW GM28352 (TP-6198 p.11)."
  },
