     "CTS: 2100-2500 ohms at 30°C (86°F), 180-200 ohms at 100°C (212°F); replace if shorted/open (TP-6198 p.58).",
     "Controller check: unplug CTS, jumper terminals A and B, start - HE about 5 s after reaching speed; remove jumper and run 30 s with no shutdown (TP-6198 p.57)."
