     "24V units (each block; meter - lead first, + lead second): pin 2 to 3 reads 0.1-0.6 V; pin 2 to 1 reads 0.2-1.2 V; pin 3 to 1 reads 0.1-0.6 V; pins 3-2, 1-2, 1-3 show no conduction. If one shows conduction, remove the bus bar and test each block (TP-6844 p.70).",
     "36/48V units: AC terminals to DC- and DC+ to AC terminals read 0.1-0.6 V; the reverse directions show no conduction; DC+ to DC- reads 0.2-1.2 V; DC- to DC+ shows none (TP-6844 p.71).",
